# flow:
(head vps)
- run migrations
- download feeds and supporting materials (like cabinets for donplafon)
- reconstruct PURE database
- serve tasks
  - downloadImage task
    - serve IMAGE which doesn't have a download_URL
    - get result/error and write IMAGE
  - processImage task
    - serve IMAGE with download_URL but without anal
    - get result/error and update IMAGE
  - videoRender task
    - serve item, made from fully valid and formatted item={pure_item, images}
    - get result/error and write to VIDEO_RENDER
- start container(s)

(worker container)
- request task from head
- proceed to worker script
- return result or error

> processImageWorker
- download image from S3 (or throw downloadError)
- anal image (or throw analError)
- return anal

> downloadImageWorker
- download image from remote (or throw downloadError)
- send image to S3 (or throw uploadError)
- return downloadURL

> videoRenderWorker
- render video with all the props and settings (or throwRenderError)
- upload to S3 (or throw uploadError)
- return url

